  "_comment": "Curated UN Treaty Collection instruments, one harvest engine over all of them (rule:configured-by-data). `unts` is the identity: the UNTS registration number in the UN's own form (I-14668), which is what the UNTS cites itself by and what survives when an instrument's depositary is not the UN. `mtdsg_no`/`chapter` complete the ViewDetailsIII.aspx status query, which carries ratifications but NO treaty text. `text` names where the authentic text really lives: the UNTS's own volumes are scans (volume 999 is 92 pages with an image on all 92), so the text comes from the depositary instead -- OHCHR for the human-rights core, legal.un.org and un.org/depts/los for the two born-digital PDFs. `title` is the authoritative English name (the page headline is generic), `sv`/`abbr` drive the folkratt listing, `group` is the Swedish subject heading it files under.",
